=== Interpretation guardrails ===
- Compare timing only among these Stage-2 multiband runs, not against the old single-band Stage-1 timing.
- CF2 build time is reported separately and excluded from compute_rir timing.
- This benchmark measures ISM source-directivity cost at fs=16 kHz and max_order=10.
- Ray tracing is not part of this benchmark.
